[Host] It means to expect or anticipate.

56
00:05:16,896 --> 00:05:24,983
[Slow] 集めたお金は、観光地の混雑を減らすことなどに使われます。

57
00:05:25,783 --> 00:05:30,776
[Host] The money collected will be used for things like reducing crowding at tourist spots.

58
